  x `tectonic-os` is not a collection this repository declares
  help: a repository is seedable only if it publishes its own modules/ as a
        collection, and declares it in `sources` under the owner they are
        imported as: that is what a seeded repository fetches them through

  x `core/hello` is in no collection the seed can name
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-seed/example.image.kdl:11:9]
 10 |     modules {
 11 |         module "core/hello"
    :         ^^^|^^
    :            `-- `tectonic-os` is not declared in `sources`
 12 |         module "steam-tweaks" {
    `----
  help: a seed lists a module by name and nothing else, so one nothing can
        import leaves a seeded repository unbuildable

  x `steam-tweaks` is in no collection the seed can name
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-seed/example.image.kdl:12:9]
 11 |         module "core/hello"
 12 |         module "steam-tweaks" {
    :         ^^^|^^
    :            `-- pinned to a source of its own
 13 |             pin {
    `----
  help: a seed lists a module by name and nothing else, so one nothing can
